      <uighur>bögemnegülkü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бөөмнүүлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BØGEMNEGYL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v, caus, of bøgemne-] v.t. To gather together; to make into a lump; to concentrate, group, collect, hoard.</definition>
